# Dynamic Device Licensing via Firebase Firestore

## Problem

The current licensing system uses a **hardcoded `Set<String>`** in [allowed_devices.dart](file:///c:/Users/Moazzam%20Samoo/Desktop/Tahir%20Showroom/lib/app/core/license/allowed_devices.dart) to gate device access. Every time a new client device needs authorization:

1. You must edit the source code
2. Rebuild the app
3. Reinstall via InnoSetup on the client machine

**Goal:** Replace this with a **Firebase Firestore** collection so you can add/remove device UUIDs from the Firebase Console — no code changes, no reinstallation needed.

