### Component 3: Firestore Schema

A single Firestore collection: **`allowed_devices`**

| Collection | Document ID | Fields |
|-----------|-------------|--------|
| `allowed_devices` | `{UUID}` | `label` (String), `addedAt` (Timestamp), `active` (bool) |

**Example document:**
```
Collection: allowed_devices
  Document ID: "E5B8A756-64CE-40C9-9846-745D225D9E8C"
    label: "Moazzam's Device"
    addedAt: April 26, 2026
    active: true
```

**Why UUID as Document ID?** — Direct lookup is O(1), costs 1 Firestore read. Maximum efficiency.

