### Component 6: Firestore Security Rules

Set in Firebase Console → Firestore → Rules:

```javascript
rules_version = '2';
service cloud.firestore {
  match /databases/{database}/documents {
    match /allowed_devices/{deviceId} {
      allow read: if true;   // App needs to read to verify license
      allow write: if false;  // No one can write from the app — only via Console
    }
    match /{document=**} {
      allow read, write: if false;
    }
  }
}
```

